{"seq":1,"slug":"chinese-history","title":"中国史","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history","introMarkdown":"# 中国史 简介\n\n中国史是对中华文明数千年发展历程的系统研究，从新石器时代的早期聚落到当代中国的全球崛起，涵盖政治制度、经济形态、社会结构、思想文化和对外关系等多个维度。这不是一部简单的编年记录，而是一个需要运用多元视角和批判方法才能深入理解的复杂叙事。\n\n自学者进入中国史领域时，面临的首要挑战是如何在宏大的时间跨度中建立有效的认知框架。一种可行的策略是先把握几个关键的历史转型节点——秦汉大一统的形成、唐宋之际的社会变革、明清的内卷化困境、近代被迫纳入世界体系的冲击——然后围绕这些节点深入展开。这比按朝代逐一学习更有助于理解历史发展的内在逻辑。\n\n第一章**古代史**聚焦从夏商周到隋唐宋元明清的漫长历史，分析中国古代政治制度的演进、经济模式的变迁和文化传统的形成。第二章**近代史**从鸦片战争到辛亥革命和民国时期，追踪中国从传统帝国向现代国家艰难转型的过程。第三章**现代史**记录一九四九年以来新中国的建设历程，包括社会主义改造、改革开放和当代中国的发展挑战。第四章**史学理论与方法**介绍历史研究的方法论基础，包括史料批判、口述历史和数字人文等研究工具，帮助从被动地接受历史叙述转向主动地分析和评价历史证据。\n\n建议以一手史料的阅读为核心训练方式，在阅读历史叙述的同时追问：这个结论建立在什么证据之上？同一事件是否存在不同的解读？历史学家的立场和时代背景如何影响了他的判断？培养这种质疑和求证的习惯，是学习历史的真正收获。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ancient-history","title":"古代史","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/ancient-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xia-shang-zhou","title":"夏商周：三代文明的建立与演变","url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/ancient-history/xia-shang-zhou"},{"seq":2,"slug":"qin-han-empires","title":"秦汉帝国：大一统国家的形成","url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/ancient-history/qin-han-empires"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tang-song-transformation","title":"唐宋变革：从贵族社会到市民社会","url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/ancient-history/tang-song-transformation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"early-modern-history","title":"近代史","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/early-modern-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"opium-wars-era","title":"鸦片战争时代：中国近代的开端","url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/early-modern-history/opium-wars-era"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reform-revolution","title":"变法与革命：从戊戌到辛亥","url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/early-modern-history/reform-revolution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"republic-of-china","title":"中华民国：1912—1949","url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/early-modern-history/republic-of-china"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-history","title":"现代史","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/modern-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"founding-of-prc","title":"新中国成立：1949—1956","url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/modern-history/founding-of-prc"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reform-opening","title":"改革开放：1978年至今的现代化进程","url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/modern-history/reform-opening"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contemporary-china","title":"当代中国：21世纪的发展与挑战","url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/modern-history/contemporary-china"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"historiography","title":"史学理论与方法","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/historiography","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"historical-methodology","title":"历史研究方法：史学方法论","url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/historiography/historical-methodology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"primary-source-analysis","title":"史料分析：原始文献的解读与运用","url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/historiography/primary-source-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-humanities","title":"数字人文：数字技术在历史研究中的应用","url":"/education/university/history/chinese-history/historiography/digital-humanities"}]}]}